    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/f326e115615fd4cf83df71e21e40be50.avif?t=1754547760\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING !</i></strong> Triple <strong>C</strong> game (<strong>C</strong>ute <strong>C</strong>ozy <strong>C</strong>ats)\u00a0<strong><i>WARNING !</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats will do almost anything to get money for their favorite cat snacks, they are even ready to commit crimes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These adorable furry thieves have broken into the most guarded fort on the entire planet, which is full of money, gold and works of fine art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help catch all these cat robbers before they steal all your stuff. Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats : Thief\u00a0is a hidden objects/hidden creatures game. The player's task is to find one hundred cats located on the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is decorated with atmospheric and hand-drawn graphics, the kittens are cozy and friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/aedc3eb6c703f3ee24b5f585d196b293.avif?t=1754547760\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 cute cats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 rubber chickens </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hidden artifacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interactive elements on the map </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn graphics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/dab3682c4fb4ed8c307fc806a630786c.avif?t=1754547760\" width=558 height=179 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/f326e115615fd4cf83df71e21e40be50.avif?t=1754547760\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>WARNING !</i></strong> Triple <strong>C</strong> game (<strong>C</strong>ute <strong>C</strong>ozy <strong>C</strong>ats)\u00a0<strong><i>WARNING !</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cats will do almost anything to get money for their favorite cat snacks, they are even ready to commit crimes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These adorable furry thieves have broken into the most guarded fort on the entire planet, which is full of money, gold and works of fine art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help catch all these cat robbers before they steal all your stuff. Meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats : Thief\u00a0is a hidden objects/hidden creatures game. The player's task is to find one hundred cats located on the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is decorated with atmospheric and hand-drawn graphics, the kittens are cozy and friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/aedc3eb6c703f3ee24b5f585d196b293.avif?t=1754547760\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 cute cats </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 rubber chickens </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 hidden artifacts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interactive elements on the map </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hand-drawn graphics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333680/extras/dab3682c4fb4ed8c307fc806a630786c.avif?t=1754547760\" width=558 height=179 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
